"Check <<jackson-serialization>> for more detail about the usage of Jackson with Kafka.\n"
"You can also use Avro."
msgstr "请参看 link:#jackson-serialization[[jackson序列化]]，了解更多关于Jackson与Kafka的使用细节。您也可以使用Avro。"

